WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Face a wall in a short lunge, front foot near the wall.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Drive the front knee toward the wall over the toes.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the front heel down.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Pulse or hold.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
